OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in van and lorry crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man died when his van collided with a
OL,6,Florry in Northamptonshire.
OL,8,FOfficers were called to reports of a
OL,9,Fcrash on the A45 Flore Bypass at 21:40
OL,10,FBST on Monday involving a white Nissan
OL,11,FTownstar van heading towards Daventry
OL,12,Fand a green HGV travelling in the
OL,13,Fopposite direction.
OL,15,FThe driver of the Nissan, a man in his
OL,16,F60s, was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FNorthamptonshire Police has referred
OL,19,Fitself to the Independent Office for
OL,20,FPolice Conduct (IOPC) because the force
OL,21,Fhad contact with the Nissan driver in
OL,22,Fthe days before the collision.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
